      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.67,
      "end_seconds": 68.37,
      "duration_seconds": 20.7,
      "text": "A pounding in my neck goes along with it, you know, most of the time. The pounding in my neck? That's been for about a week. As for pounding in my neck, it feels mild to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.32,
      "end_seconds": 87.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "okay, have you had any family history of sudden death, chest pain, fainting or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.21,
      "end_seconds": 91.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.35,
      "end_seconds": 95.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "your breathing any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.1,
      "end_seconds": 99.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
